- `property_type`
- `area_profile`
- `physical_attributes`
- `microzone_match_ratio`
- `segment_depth`
- `price_surface_context`
- data quality aplicable al input manual

Debe excluir o marcar como `not_applicable`:

- `published_price`
- `discount_pct`
- `listing_identity`
- `listing_id`
- `URL`
- `watchlist_state`
- `price_history_series`
